WEBVTT

00:10:28.315 --> 00:10:30.382
to question its own status quo.

00:10:31.748 --> 00:10:34.962
Little by little, I'm hoping
I can keep doing this work,

00:10:35.835 --> 00:10:38.264
and continue refocusing society's lens

00:10:38.288 --> 00:10:41.630
so that nobody else gets overlooked.

00:10:41.944 --> 00:10:43.095
Thank you.

00:10:43.119 --> 00:10:47.531
(Applause)